Replacement policy
------------------
If the base is later switched to a BoringSSL or AWS-LC prebuilt, this NOTICE
must be updated to reflect the new upstream project, version, and hash
(RFC 035 §1.4: version locking + independent PR updates; no "updated" claim
without tracking upstream security releases).

All components above are Apache-2.0 compatible. No GPL/AGPL/LGPL-2.1-only or
other incompatible licenses are vendored.
